<<^ code=`&#x0001;` from=`?` to=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.offer.promotes`>>
<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "land one reviewed offer into canon by its cid, as the steward"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///realm.offer.promotes", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.offer.promotes"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.offer.promotes"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.offer.promotes ~ the steward lands an offer toward canon

`lares meme offer promote <cid>` lands one offer (its 64-hex cid, as `meme offer show` lists it) into the house-canon bag it offered toward, through the daemon, retiring the offer behind it. `over-fresher=true` lands it over a fresher record standing there. A retire the charter seats did not seal stays pending and names why.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ promote · over-fresher

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`promote` params=`cid/<cid> ~ land one offer`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`over-fresher` params=`cid/<cid> over-fresher/true ~ land it over a fresher record`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ cid · over-fresher

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`cid` params=`takes/cid needs/required seat/1 as/<cid> ~ the offer's cid, 64 hex`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`over-fresher` params=`kind/switch ~ land over a fresher record standing in canon`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ steward

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`steward` params=`who/seat-or-hand ocap/kahu-reach-on-the-canon-bag ~ the daemon reads the steward's reach on the canon bag the offer names`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · cap-denied · owed · verb-error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.offer.promotes cid/<cid>]] ~ name one offer cid, 64 hex`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`cap-denied` params=`~ no reach on the canon bag the offer names`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`owed` params=`~ the act stands owed; the daemon answers it later`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`verb-error` params=`~ the landing or its retire refused; the reason rides the message`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ promoted

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`promoted` params=`exit/0 fields/[[retire retirePending]] ~ the offer landed; retire names the retirement, pending where it waits`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares meme offer promote

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares meme offer promote]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

